# Whack-a-Mole — Game Prompt

Build a modern, dependency-free HTML5 Canvas game called **Whack-a-Mole**.

## Concept
Moles pop up fast and random — smack them before they duck to build combos and beat the clock.

## Features
  - Random mole spawning with timing
  - Score streaks and combo multiplier
  - Countdown timer and game-over screen

## Visual Style (required — "modern, attractive, today's style, innovative")
- Dark animated gradient background and ambient particles.
- Glassmorphism HUD panels (blurred translucent cards).
- Gradient title text (background-clip) and gradient buttons.
- Glowing elements (canvas shadowBlur), smooth animations, cohesive palette.
- No external assets or network requests.

## Technical constraints
- Vanilla JavaScript (ES2020+), single IIFE module, requestAnimationFrame loop.
- No frameworks, no CDN, no libraries, no build step. Fully offline/self-contained.

